  unitName: Holy Blades Sefia
  unitId: 50165
  unitNumber: 486
  description: The woman warrior who wore 8 blades on her back. Throwing away the
    responsibility she had been given of judging otherworldly beings, she turned
    her blades on the gods. In the heat of battle, she once again came face to face
    with an old foe. The smell of blood drifting through the air, she swore that
    if she was able to survive the battle that they would fight just the two of them
    once again. As she said this, blades shot out from the back of the wicked creature
    that stood before her.
  summonDesc: I entrust my eight blades to you.<br>Let us decide together at whom<br>we
    will use them on!
  fusionDesc: What's the meaning of fighting?<br>Hehe, I've never even thought<br>of
    such a thing before.
  evoDesc: Focus on your mission in life.<br>I will be your sword and cut <br>open
    for you a path forward!
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
